OL,3,ARay Quinn says baby boy was 'born
OL,4,Asleeping'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger and actor Ray Quinn has spoken
OL,7,Fof the "heartbreaking" loss of his baby
OL,8,Fson, Rio, who was stillborn.
OL,10,FThe former Brookside actor said his son
OL,11,FRio was "born sleeping" on 20 August at
OL,12,FLiverpool Women's University Hospital.
OL,14,FQuinn said his son was a "beautiful
OL,15,Fboy" as he paid tribute on his
OL,16,FInstagram page.
OL,18,FHe said: "No words will ever be enough,
OL,19,Fjust a lot of indescribable feelings."
